OL,3,GNEWSACharger warning after model plane
OL,4,Asparks house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA model aircraft enthusiast has warned
OL,7,Fpeople not to leave lithium batteries
OL,8,Funattended while charging after his
OL,9,Fhome was badly damaged in a fire.
OL,11,FTim Harwood was charging a model in the
OL,12,Fkitchen of his home in Ashby
OL,13,Fde-la-Zouch, Leicestershire, on
OL,14,FSaturday, but a fire broke out while he
OL,15,Fwas outside gardening.
OL,17,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,Fhas advised the public to buy
OL,19,Fbatteries, devices and chargers from
OL,20,Freputable suppliers and ensure they are
OL,21,Fusing the correct charger for the
OL,22,Fproduct.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
