OL,3,GNEWSACharger warning after model plane
OL,4,Asparks house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 73-year-old said he had followed
OL,7,Fthis advice to the letter - but his
OL,8,Fhome still caught fire and repair work
OL,9,Fcould take about a year to complete.
